IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0017.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY PEN0017C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 WS-PWV             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 WS-PEN             PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "WS-PWV=" WS-PWV
    DISPLAY "WS-PEN=" WS-PEN
    STOP RUN.
FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER.
    IF CU-FO-IND = 'Y'
        *> PREMIUM FIRST-OFFENCE WAIVER
        IF CU-WS-TIER = 'G' OR CU-WS-TIER = 'P'
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-PWV
            MOVE 0 TO WS-PEN
        ELSE
            IF CU-WS-DLT <= 7
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-PWV
                MOVE 0 TO WS-PEN
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
